<title>SWITZERLAND: Vontobel boosts 1996 net 46 pct, raises div.</title>
<headline>Vontobel boosts 1996 net 46 pct, raises div.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vontobel Holding AG said group net profit excluding minorities rose 46 percent in 1996 to 60.2 million Swiss francs and that its board would propose raising the dividend on bearer shares to 25 francs from 22.</p>
<p> (millions of Sfr unless noted)	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Group net (excluding minorities)     60.2	 41.1</p>
<p> Cash flow				   112.4	 68.0</p>
<p> Assets under management (billions)   35.7	 24.5</p>
<p> Return on equity (pct)		   13.5	  9.8</p>
<p>Note - The company will provide information on its audited accounts at a news conference on April 16. The annual shareholders meeting will be held on May 12.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
